/* DealCraft — Company Law Ch 4 · Lesson 4B Classification, part 3 of 3: listed and public
   interest companies, VCCs, corporate groups (audited Oct 2026). Source: Lee Ch 4 [04.019]–[04.026], fns 62–100. */
